The main expected results are: 
- 15 SMEs assessed and reports on RECP improvements developed; 
- 10 business plans to implement RECP measures prepared, 
- 15 experts trained on RECP methodology; 
- 2 RECP Clubs established and 12 modules implemented for about 20 enterprises in two selected regions (Gagauzia and Kahul); 
- RECP action plans developed by about 20 enterprises; 
- feasibility study of Eco-Industrial Parks framework application at Tracom IP and Valkanes FEZ is completed, 
-2 reports with recommendations are developed; 
- 2 specialized RECP training modules implemented.
